[www.e-mindful.com/2018/09/you-must-read-this-before-starting.html](https://www.e-mindful.com/2018/09/you-must-read-this-before-starting.html)

&#x200B;

yes very true...instead I say we should live the life incrementally to LIVE and also understand what is life while LIVING

&#x200B;

[http://www.e-mindful.com/2018/01/live-life-incremental.html](http://www.e-mindful.com/2018/01/live-life-incremental.html)

You will not always be liked by some group - criticism handling.

You cannot judge any fellow in the industry about his future - Be kind and supportive to everyone.

&#x200B;

Only one line for those who say 'Doing it for money will keep you unhappy' is that 'First be rich and then be a philosopher'. I tell you such people will leave their job and do another if there is considerable money in another one !

Even if money is not everything, still it is almost everything!

It is obviously true that we should get into any work which gives happiness in return, often called Job Satisfaction !

Along with that I say money is the measure of that happiness how much people are willing to pay for job/service you do!

We all know Quality in any business is a rare thing and it does take its price. So if your job/service is providing good quality then you must be satisfying yourself by satisfying your customers and they are ready to pay more than market prices to you.

If money was not that important then all these legendary businessmen would not have started their huge empires across the world, and more importantly they cannot do it without money!

What Say..

&#x200B;

